graph TD
    subgraph R["<b>Requirement</b> — <i>whether</i> it starts"]
        R1["Requires= — if it fails, we fail"]
        R2["Wants= — start it too, but carry on if it fails"]
        R3["BindsTo= — if it stops, we stop"]
    end
    subgraph O["<b>Ordering</b> — <i>when</i> it starts"]
        O1["After= — not before that one is up"]
        O2["Before= — the same edge, written from the other end"]
    end
    R --> X["<b>They are orthogonal.</b><br/>Requires= with no After= starts both<br/>at the same instant — which is the<br/>commonest unit-file bug there is"]
    O --> X
